{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019Wy37k9W1FfjCmww5kZP6k","type":"tool_result","content":"FAIL the Director walks the whole story on path B (40 beats): e4.i4 > e5.card > e5.two > e5.count > e5.after > e5.dawn > e5.montage > e5.credits i5=null\n1 check(s) failed\nusage: viewport-matrix [-h] [-o OUT] [--engines ENGINES] [--all-engines]\n                       [--only ONLY] [--devices DEVICES] [--full-page]\n                       [--dpr1] [--wait WAIT] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--headed]\n                       url\n\nScreenshot a URL across phone / foldable / tablet / desktop viewports in Chromium, WebKit and Firefox.\n\nWrites one PNG per (device, engine) plus index.html (contact sheet drawn to relative scale) and\nreport.json, and flags horizontal overflow, console errors, page errors and failed requests.\n\nBy default each device runs on the engine it really ships with (iPhone/iPad -> WebKit,\nAndroid -> Chromium) and desktop sizes run on all three engines.\n\n  viewport-matrix http://localhost:5173\n  viewport-matrix http://localhost:5173/play -o /tmp/shots --full-page\n  viewport-matrix URL --engines firefox              # everything in Firefox\n  viewport-matrix URL --all-engines                  # every device x every engine\n  viewport-matrix URL --only phone,foldable --dpr1   # small files, mobile only\n\npositional arguments:\n  url\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help         show this help message and exit\n  -o, --out OUT      output dir (default: $TMPDIR/viewport-matrix/<timestamp>)\n  --engines ENGINES  comma list from chromium,webkit,firefox\n  --all-engines      run every device on every selected engine\n  --only ONLY        comma list of categories: phone,foldable,tablet,desktop\n  --devices DEVICES  comma list of Playwright device names to use instead of\n                     the built-in matrix","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c954ed14-e406-494c-b7ce-2e71ce3da87b","uuid":"0995cb39-c747-44c7-92c7